{"id":"ti_o","lemma":"tío","pos":"noun","rank":247,"glosses":["uncle (the brother, brother-in-law, or male cousin or cousin-in-law of either parent)","unknown or any male person, dude, guy","friend, mate, pal, man, bro"],"ipa":"/ˈtio/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"tíos","feminine":"tía","femininePlural":"tías"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/36/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-t%C3%ADo.wav","formAudio":{"tía":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/07/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-t%C3%ADa.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Él es mi tío.","en":"He is my uncle.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/68265"},{"text":"Tom tiene tres tíos.","en":"Tom has three uncles."},{"text":"Mi tía parece joven.","en":"My aunt looks young.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449826"},{"text":"Él tiene dos tías de parte materna.","en":"He has two aunts on his mother's side."},{"text":"Mi tío es rico.","en":"My uncle is rich.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442931"}]}